# Boot-animation player acceptance for the nubia-ly guard.
#
# Put the single word  ANY  on a line to accept any legitimate stock player
# (root-owned, real file, not a symlink) WITHOUT an exact hash. Set it once and
# you never need to re-capture after a firmware/Android update.
ANY
#
# --- Stricter mode (optional) ---
# Instead of ANY, list one sha256 of /system/lib64/libbootanimation.so per line.
# Capture on the phone:  su -c 'sha256sum /system/lib64/libbootanimation.so'
# (A15 and A16 differ, so you'd add a new line after each update.)
# NX789J / Android 15 example, captured 2026-10-17:
# e5242e6a702fa8971966448a7b6ebf359c6a6238fa79ac01331a9cb2fba223aa
